{"version":"1","id":"snipcart","handle":"snipcart","name":"SNIPCART","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/c6215d952a6e4aed84fa48e2f97387fd","description":null,"is_squad":false,"x":-5.9885,"y":1.9927,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":38,"newest_post_at":"2022-05-12T20:04:14.109Z","oldest_post_at":"2020-04-09T00:00:00.000Z","features":{"hype_score":0.0,"listicle_ratio":0.026316,"question_ratio":0.052632,"avg_read_time":9.272727,"summary_length_avg":303.842105,"title_length_avg":50.842105,"title_length_var":153.711911,"tag_entropy":3.229155,"tag_diversity":0.973684,"top_tag_share":0.263158,"avg_upvotes":10.157895,"median_upvotes":2.0,"avg_comments":0.421053,"comment_to_upvote_ratio":0.043928,"zero_engagement_share":0.368421,"viral_share":0.026316,"posts_per_week":0.348544,"non_article_ratio":0.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"recency_skew":0.1875},"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[7.1618,2.8971],"cadence_depth":[-5.7647,5.7941],"hype_variety":[-5.0735,0.4853],"title_style":[6.0,6.25]},"top_tags":[["ecommerce",12],["webdev",10],["react",7],["javascript",6],["general-programming",5],["jamstack",5],["gatsby",4],["wordpress",4]],"sample_titles":{"representative":["The 6 Best JavaScript Frameworks to Use in 2022","JavaScript Practice Exercises for All Levels","Astro: Less JavaScript & More HTML"],"outlier":["How to Use a Headless CMS to Personalize Your Jamstack E-Commerce Site [Tutorial and Live Demo Included]"]},"recent_posts":[{"id":"4xMwnI3nW","title":"What Is Cypress Testing and 4 Steps to Get Started","url":"https://snipcart.com/blog/what-is-cypress","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-is-cypress-testing-and-4-steps-to-get-started-4xmwni3nw","summary":"Cypress is a modern and complete end-to-end testing framework. It works on all platforms and all browsers. Cypress tests are written in JavaScript and run in a real browser. It uses an event-based architecture that hooks into Google Chrome\u2019s lifecycle events.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4bad583fe9b1083a7e8e72a272f205bc","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-05-12T20:04:14.109Z"},{"id":"BYRruiQPY","title":"Ecommerce Integration for Ghost in 10 Minutes","url":"https://snipcart.com/blog/ghost-ecommerce","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/ecommerce-integration-for-ghost-in-10-minutes-byrruiqpy","summary":"Ghost is a popular open-source blogging platform started by John O'Nolan & Hannah Wolfe in 2013. Its lean UI and WYSIWYG editor make it a clean and easy-to-use solution that simplifies the content creation process. Ghost is not an eCommerce platform, but with the right tools, it can become a good solution to turn your blog into a simple eCommerce store.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/486df03aa968489bc0619db4f0900302","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-04-29T14:11:24.035Z"},{"id":"R1-FBHEi1","title":"The 6 Best JavaScript Frameworks to Use in 2022","url":"https://snipcart.com/blog/javascript-frameworks","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-6-best-javascript-frameworks-to-use-in-2022-r1-fbhei1","summary":"JavaScript frameworks are tried and tested tools for building scalable web applications. They contain a collection of JavaScript code libraries that provide pre-written JS code for standard programming features and tasks. Frameworks enable you to add functionalities like testing and linting to ensure you're shipping error-free code. There are more than 20 frameworks and 80 libraries for developers to choose from.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3d69446e750b280d478829d316e86493","num_upvotes":104,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2022-03-24T12:59:54.404Z"},{"id":"LkKDNtpdD","title":"What is Headless WordPress & Should You Use It?","url":"https://snipcart.com/blog/headless-wordpress","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-is-headless-wordpress-should-you-use-it--lkkdntpdd","summary":"W3Techs: WordPress is the most popular CMS in the world, powering 43.3% of the world\u2019s websites. WordPress is built as a monolithic platform with a tightly coupled front and backend. Going headless unlocks a variety of new opportunities for WordPress developers by opening the door for new frameworks, tech stacks, and delivery channels.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/e790135272b4da80e2f778587e879b46","num_upvotes":18,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2022-03-15T16:33:30.255Z"},{"id":"rTtVk7-2y","title":"5 Best Angular Tutorials for Beginners","url":"https://snipcart.com/blog/angular-tutorial","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/5-best-angular-tutorials-for-beginners-rttvk7-2y","summary":"Angular is a frontend component-based framework. It offers developers a collection of integrated libraries and a suite of tools to develop, test, and update their code. To help you learn about this JavaScript framework, I surveyed the Angular communities and developers at Snipcart and came up with the best tutorials.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3b378403da0614d6a6488c62cfc3bec9","num_upvotes":6,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-02-17T20:19:38.344Z"},{"id":"3osaEpSsi","title":"Next.js vs. React: The Difference & Best Frontend Framework","url":"https://snipcart.com/blog/next-js-vs-react","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/next-js-vs-react-the-difference-best-frontend-framework-3osaepssi","summary":"React is the most popular JavaScript library for frontend developers. Next.js is a frontend JavaSript framework that builds upon React\u2019s UI library. With new JavaScript frameworks and libraries coming out every year, it gets hard to keep up with the pace of the changing JS ecosystem.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/fb81d08193942efeeeb7c5f5c6ed6aae","num_upvotes":18,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-02-14T21:17:30.248Z"},{"id":"IqqHOsmn7","title":"Microservices vs. API: The Benefits of Using Microservices","url":"https://snipcart.com/blog/microservices-vs-api","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/microservices-vs-api-the-benefits-of-using-microservices-iqqhosmn7","summary":"Microservices break large applications into independent parts, giving developers more flexibility to create lean, performant applications. An API is a bridge that enables microservices to communicate with the server and other APIs. Not every microservice has to be part of an API, so these technologies are more complementary than competing.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/553096b93bdcb03867871ec2f3bec5ea","num_upvotes":6,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-02-07T18:27:40.015Z"},{"id":"WN2-K8sJd","title":"JavaScript Practice Exercises for All Levels","url":"https://snipcart.com/blog/javascript-practice-exercises","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/javascript-practice-exercises-for-all-levels-wn2-k8sjd","summary":"JavaScript is a high-level, interpreted language just like Python. It can be used in the front-end and run on the client-side/browser or in the back-end with node.js. With it, you can build:Complete full-stack web apps. Mobile apps (with React Native or Ionic) Desktop apps ( with Electron.js), and shopping cart solutions.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/c485b4de7147d4b4fe68f6c4534abc92","num_upvotes":84,"num_comments":7,"created_at":"2022-01-14T19:01:55.000Z"},{"id":"GxKKHx5VG","title":"Add a Shopping Cart to a Website in 4 Minutes","url":"https://snipcart.com/blog/add-shopping-cart-to-website","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/add-a-shopping-cart-to-a-website-in-4-minutes-gxkkhx5vg","summary":"Snipcart is a powerful, easy-to-install shopping cart platform. You can use it to transform any site or web application into an eCommerce website in minutes. It also includes a full suite of features making it a complete solution. This tutorial shows you how to add a shopping cart to a static HTML website.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/c485b4de7147d4b4fe68f6c4534abc92","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-01-07T01:12:22.734Z"},{"id":"Yn6pmz5x6","title":"Top 5 Best Online Shopping Cart for 2022","url":"https://snipcart.com/blog/best-online-shopping-cart","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/top-5-best-online-shopping-cart-for-2022-yn6pmz5x6","summary":"With the advent of Covid, building an online store for your business is even more important. For small businesses, finding the best online shopping cart to fit their needs can be a difficult task. Here's a curated list of the best shopping carts for your eCommerce website.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/c485b4de7147d4b4fe68f6c4534abc92","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-12-09T19:42:26.782Z"}],"similar_handles":["nette","implementing","swizec","taro","crunchydata"],"opposite_handles":["felixrieseberg","tbpn","hamelhusain","alexfinn","ryolu_"],"similar":[{"id":"nette","handle":"nette","name":"Nette","is_squad":false,"x":-5.9197,"y":1.8573,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":32,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/54476ee5012b4cdaa4811d869af060ed","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":0.15683,"median_upvotes":1.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"hype_score":0.0,"avg_read_time":3.25,"tag_diversity":0.625},"top_tags_preview":[["php",19],["webdev",6],["security",6]],"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[3.3971,2.2941],"cadence_depth":[-6.4559,-6.1912],"hype_variety":[-6.2353,-6.3676],"title_style":[6.9118,-4.0441]}},{"id":"implementing","handle":"implementing","name":"Implementing","is_squad":false,"x":-5.8608,"y":2.1213,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":31,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--E1IO6tMp--/f_auto/v1716619618/logos/implementi